                                                "sense_id": "4fd6df02-10dd-3444-b7e6-4105a97e7a23",
                                                "text": "\"Good Lord! oh, Lord! Why, my dear sir, what duty do you owe to the public? The only duty you owe is to me, your publisher! It is your duty to write what will sell, and I tell you reasons are unmarketable commodities.\""
